IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ccaa-agreements`

-- Choice of Court Agreements Act 2016, ss 2 to 6, 8 to 16, 20 and 24 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_choice-of-court-agreements-act-2016.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`Singapore clause, cross-border supply` MEANS Dispute WITH
    `the matter` IS `a commercial supply contract`
    `the matter arises only as a preliminary question or defence` IS FALSE
    `the parties reside in the same Contracting State` IS FALSE
    `everything else is connected only with that State` IS FALSE
    `in writing or an accessible record` IS TRUE
    `designates the courts of one Contracting State` IS TRUE
    `says other courts are excluded` IS TRUE
    `the parties expressly made it non-exclusive` IS FALSE
    `a Singapore court is chosen` IS TRUE
    `concluded before 1 October 2016` IS FALSE
    `concluded before the Convention bound the chosen State` IS FALSE
    `the claim is for an interim measure` IS FALSE

